WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:30.750
In the previous verses,

2
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:31.791
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:31.791 --> 00:00:35.125
described His various vibhutis.

4
00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:37.375
Now in this thirty-fourth verse,

5
00:00:37.375 --> 00:00:39.041
He reveals His presence

6
00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:42.791
both as the inevitable end of life

7
00:00:42.791 --> 00:00:45.416
and as the inspiring source of virtues.

8
00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:46.583
He describes death

9
00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:48.583
as the supreme power

10
00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:50.541
that takes everything away.

11
00:00:50.541 --> 00:00:51.458
He also

12
00:00:51.458 --> 00:00:54.916
speaks of His creative principle

13
00:00:54.916 --> 00:00:57.416
that gives birth to what is yet to come.

14
00:00:57.416 --> 00:01:00.041
Among the virtues associated with

15
00:01:00.041 --> 00:01:01.375
feminine or nurturing qualities,

16
00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:04.916
Lord Krishna highlights seven special qualities

17
00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:09.000
as His divine manifestations.

18
00:01:13.708 --> 00:01:15.625
Lord Krishna says,

19
00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:18.958
'I am death, which takes all.'

20
00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:21.625
Lord Krishna declares Himself sarva-hara –

21
00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:24.875
the one who takes all.

22
00:01:24.875 --> 00:01:28.250
That death which takes everything away –

23
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:30.875
wealth, relationships, reputation,

24
00:01:30.875 --> 00:01:33.500
and even a person's identity. 

25
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.208
Death is the great equaliser.

26
00:01:36.208 --> 00:01:40.083
It reminds us of the
impermanence of material life.

27
00:01:40.083 --> 00:01:42.125
Lord Krishna's presence in death

28
00:01:42.125 --> 00:01:44.458
reveals His control.

29
00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:47.916
It is His authority over the final transformation.

30
00:01:47.916 --> 00:01:50.666
Seen this way, death is not just an ending.

31
00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:52.416
It is a supporting force

32
00:01:52.416 --> 00:01:54.125
of cosmic order.

33
00:01:54.125 --> 00:01:55.708
The divine power

34
00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:59.833
that drives the natural cycle of existence.

35
00:01:59.833 --> 00:02:02.416
Lord Krishna further says,

36
00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:04.333
'I am the creative principle

37
00:02:04.333 --> 00:02:06.125
that brings forth

38
00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:09.750
all that is yet to come.'

39
00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.791
While death takes everything away,

40
00:02:12.791 --> 00:02:13.916
Lord Krishna

41
00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:17.666
also embodies the principle of birth.

42
00:02:17.666 --> 00:02:20.791
The principle of new life beginning,

43
00:02:20.791 --> 00:02:22.916
Lord Krishna's dual nature –

44
00:02:22.916 --> 00:02:24.708
both as destroyer and creator –

45
00:02:24.708 --> 00:02:27.291
reflects the continuous flow

46
00:02:27.291 --> 00:02:29.458
of existence.

47
00:02:29.458 --> 00:02:32.458
Birth is not merely a biological event.

48
00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:34.916
It is a divine occurrence,

49
00:02:34.916 --> 00:02:38.250
one that requires Lord Krishna's sanction.

50
00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:40.541
As described in the Shrimad Bhagavatam,

51
00:02:40.541 --> 00:02:43.500
even when all conditions seem favourable,

52
00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:48.458
life cannot manifest without the divine touch.

53
00:02:48.458 --> 00:02:50.291
Lord Krishna highlights seven qualities

54
00:02:50.291 --> 00:02:52.708
associated with the feminine nature,

55
00:02:52.708 --> 00:02:54.833
which reveal His vibhuti.

56
00:02:54.833 --> 00:02:58.500
These virtues are reflections of His divine nature.

57
00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.416
The first quality is kirti.

58
00:03:00.416 --> 00:03:03.750
Fame earned through righteous
conduct is a lasting quality.

59
00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.375
It is praised

60
00:03:05.375 --> 00:03:07.208
and remembered.

61
00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:09.291
It inspires others

62
00:03:09.291 --> 00:03:12.416
and reflects Lord Krishna's influence.

63
00:03:12.416 --> 00:03:15.375
The second quality is shri,
which includes wealth,

64
00:03:15.375 --> 00:03:18.375
prosperity, and beauty.

65
00:03:18.375 --> 00:03:20.875
It is an expression of divine grace,

66
00:03:20.875 --> 00:03:23.208
as seen in Lakshmi,

67
00:03:23.208 --> 00:03:26.541
the goddess of fortune and
companion of Vishnu.

68
00:03:26.541 --> 00:03:29.250
The third quality is vak – the ability

69
00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:33.000
to express thoughts with
clarity and beauty, which is

70
00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.416
a powerful tool of communication
and influence.

71
00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:39.583
The fourth quality is smriti – memory,

72
00:03:39.583 --> 00:03:42.291
the ability to hold and recall knowledge,

73
00:03:42.291 --> 00:03:44.208
experience, and wisdom.

74
00:03:44.208 --> 00:03:47.208
It reflects Lord Krishna's vibhuti.

75
00:03:47.208 --> 00:03:50.750
Memory connects the past and present,

76
00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.833
shaping one's understanding of life.

77
00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:54.958
The fifth quality is

78
00:03:54.958 --> 00:03:57.666
medha – intellect,

79
00:03:57.666 --> 00:03:59.083
which enables discernment,

80
00:03:59.083 --> 00:04:01.750
comprehension, and the
application of knowledge.

81
00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:04.291
It reflects Lord Krishna's

82
00:04:04.291 --> 00:04:07.375
guiding presence in all intellectual activity.

83
00:04:07.375 --> 00:04:10.458
The sixth quality is dhriti – steadfastness,

84
00:04:10.458 --> 00:04:13.583
the ability to remain firm and
resolved in the face of challenges.

85
00:04:13.583 --> 00:04:16.291
It reveals Lord Krishna's strength

86
00:04:16.291 --> 00:04:19.541
and inspires perseverance in difficulty.

87
00:04:19.541 --> 00:04:21.666
The seventh quality is kshama – patience,

88
00:04:21.666 --> 00:04:24.708
which holds within it humility, tolerance,

89
00:04:24.708 --> 00:04:28.833
and the ability to bear joy and
sorrow with equanimity.

90
00:04:28.833 --> 00:04:30.458
It reflects Lord Krishna's compassion

91
00:04:30.458 --> 00:04:32.750
and grace.

92
00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.666
These qualities are associated
with the feminine nature,

93
00:04:35.666 --> 00:04:38.208
as they are connected to nurturing aspects.

94
00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:39.500
But men too

95
00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.541
can embody these virtues

96
00:04:41.541 --> 00:04:43.708
and express them.

97
00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:44.583
This verse

98
00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:46.416
inspires us to see Lord Krishna

99
00:04:46.416 --> 00:04:49.500
in every aspect of life.

100
00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.166
In inevitable realities like death,

101
00:04:52.166 --> 00:04:55.375
and in virtues like patience and intellect.

102
00:04:55.375 --> 00:04:56.500
By recognising His presence

103
00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.750
in these manifestations,

104
00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:02.125
we can develop gratitude, humility, and

105
00:05:02.125 --> 00:05:04.791
a deep bond with the divine.

106
00:05:09.041 --> 00:05:11.458
Life is temporary,

107
00:05:11.458 --> 00:05:15.083
and its inevitable and certain end

108
00:05:15.083 --> 00:05:16.916
is death.

109
00:05:16.916 --> 00:05:18.541
Yet

110
00:05:18.541 --> 00:05:21.250
you often get caught up in the ordinary,

111
00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:24.250
perishable things of this world,

112
00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:27.750
chasing wealth, fame, or pleasures,

113
00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:31.375
forgetting the important purpose

114
00:05:31.375 --> 00:05:35.625
of your existence.

115
00:05:35.625 --> 00:05:38.250
Death is certain.

116
00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:41.000
Remembering this does not mean

117
00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.958
either fearing it

118
00:05:43.958 --> 00:05:48.208
or ignoring it completely.

119
00:05:48.208 --> 00:05:50.000
One person gets frightened

120
00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.916
by even a small illness.

121
00:05:52.916 --> 00:05:55.125
They get many tests done.

122
00:05:55.125 --> 00:05:58.166
They keep visiting doctors,

123
00:05:58.166 --> 00:06:02.208
and in food and drink they
avoid far more than necessary.

124
00:06:02.208 --> 00:06:04.041
Such a person can neither

125
00:06:04.041 --> 00:06:07.125
enjoy life naturally

126
00:06:07.125 --> 00:06:10.916
nor do anything creative.

127
00:06:10.916 --> 00:06:12.916
On the other hand,

128
00:06:12.916 --> 00:06:16.500
another person, thinking

129
00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.458
'Everyone has to die one day,'

130
00:06:19.458 --> 00:06:23.500
stays drowned all the time in indulgence,

131
00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:26.250
and loses health, relationships,

132
00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:30.416
and wealth, all of it.

133
00:06:30.416 --> 00:06:33.625
Extremes must be avoided everywhere.

134
00:06:33.625 --> 00:06:37.500
Walk the balanced path.

135
00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.875
Do not fear death.

136
00:06:39.875 --> 00:06:42.583
It is an inevitable truth.

137
00:06:42.583 --> 00:06:43.583
See it as a

138
00:06:43.583 --> 00:06:46.541
natural transformation

139
00:06:46.541 --> 00:06:50.458
that takes the soul toward a new birth.

140
00:06:50.458 --> 00:06:53.458
Understanding this reality of change,

141
00:06:53.458 --> 00:06:56.875
live a life connected with spiritual

142
00:06:56.875 --> 00:06:59.666
growth, meaningful relationships,

143
00:06:59.666 --> 00:07:02.875
and higher values.

144
00:07:02.875 --> 00:07:04.166
So come,

145
00:07:04.166 --> 00:07:08.041
give priority to spiritual practices.

146
00:07:08.041 --> 00:07:10.791
Strive to connect with Me,

147
00:07:10.791 --> 00:07:12.875
and prepare yourself

148
00:07:12.875 --> 00:07:15.666
for that end of life

149
00:07:15.666 --> 00:07:18.958
which is certain and inevitable.

150
00:07:18.958 --> 00:07:23.791
Living this way, you will
make every moment purposeful

151
00:07:23.791 --> 00:07:26.958
and fulfilling.

152
00:07:31.458 --> 00:07:35.458
If you want peace in the home,
adopt these three qualities.

153
00:07:35.458 --> 00:07:38.208
The first – sweet speech.

154
00:07:38.208 --> 00:07:41.125
Will your words carry the sweetness of honey

155
00:07:41.125 --> 00:07:45.208
or the sharpness of a blade?
That is for you to decide.

156
00:07:45.208 --> 00:07:49.125
Imagine the family sitting together.

157
00:07:49.125 --> 00:07:52.416
Suddenly tension arises over something.

158
00:07:52.416 --> 00:07:54.208
Now what will you do?

159
00:07:54.208 --> 00:07:57.416
Will you shout or explain?

160
00:07:57.416 --> 00:08:01.083
Will you speak bitter words or gentle ones?

161
00:08:01.083 --> 00:08:04.625
Choose the words that heal wounds.

162
00:08:04.625 --> 00:08:07.708
Speak what connects relationships.

163
00:08:07.708 --> 00:08:11.083
Never speak bitterly.

164
00:08:11.083 --> 00:08:12.875
The second is patience.

165
00:08:12.875 --> 00:08:14.875
Patience with yourself,

166
00:08:14.875 --> 00:08:17.708
and patience with others too.

167
00:08:17.708 --> 00:08:21.083
When your child makes a mistake, not anger,

168
00:08:21.083 --> 00:08:22.458
show patience.

169
00:08:22.458 --> 00:08:24.791
When you yourself make a mistake,

170
00:08:24.791 --> 00:08:28.250
be kind to yourself as well.

171
00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:32.000
No one is perfect.

172
00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.041
When in the family, with patience,

173
00:08:34.041 --> 00:08:38.125
each other's imperfections are accepted,

174
00:08:38.125 --> 00:08:41.916
striving for improvement becomes easier,

175
00:08:41.916 --> 00:08:46.000
and with this goodwill, love only grows.

176
00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:49.166
The third is gratitude.

177
00:08:49.166 --> 00:08:50.333
Remember

178
00:08:50.333 --> 00:08:53.958
what others have done for you.

179
00:08:53.958 --> 00:08:56.750
A mother's sleepless nights,

180
00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.666
a father's hard work, a spouse's sacrifice,

181
00:08:59.666 --> 00:09:03.500
children's love – do not forget these.

182
00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:06.416
When you express gratitude,

183
00:09:06.416 --> 00:09:09.708
the home becomes a joyful place.

184
00:09:09.708 --> 00:09:13.458
When you honour the contribution of others,

185
00:09:13.458 --> 00:09:16.791
relationships grow stronger.

186
00:09:16.791 --> 00:09:20.291
Sweet speech, patience, gratitude –

187
00:09:20.291 --> 00:09:21.625
these three

188
00:09:21.625 --> 00:09:26.250
turn your home into a temple of love.

189
00:09:30.583 --> 00:09:33.791
Challenges and obstacles

190
00:09:33.791 --> 00:09:38.916
are an inseparable part of both life and leadership.

191
00:09:38.916 --> 00:09:41.666
They will come.

192
00:09:41.666 --> 00:09:43.458
Just as

193
00:09:43.458 --> 00:09:45.375
on one hand I

194
00:09:45.375 --> 00:09:49.666
am death, the end of all things,

195
00:09:49.666 --> 00:09:54.583
on the other hand, the beginning of new life

196
00:09:54.583 --> 00:09:56.208
is also Me.

197
00:09:56.208 --> 00:09:58.916
As a leader,

198
00:09:58.916 --> 00:10:02.083
you too, in the same way, two

199
00:10:02.083 --> 00:10:06.208
opposite ideas must embrace together.

200
00:10:06.208 --> 00:10:08.333
You must know

201
00:10:08.333 --> 00:10:12.625
when to bid farewell to old methods, tools,

202
00:10:12.625 --> 00:10:16.791
and the command of old successes

203
00:10:16.791 --> 00:10:21.583
that are no longer useful for the work.

204
00:10:21.583 --> 00:10:24.041
For example, old machines

205
00:10:24.041 --> 00:10:27.083
that consume more electricity

206
00:10:27.083 --> 00:10:29.958
and produce less output –

207
00:10:29.958 --> 00:10:31.125
replacing them

208
00:10:31.125 --> 00:10:32.458
with machines that, on less electricity,

209
00:10:32.458 --> 00:10:35.125
produce more output

210
00:10:35.125 --> 00:10:36.583
is wisdom.

211
00:10:36.583 --> 00:10:39.625
Letting go, or removing the old,

212
00:10:39.625 --> 00:10:42.625
is neither harshness

213
00:10:42.625 --> 00:10:46.083
nor failure, but

214
00:10:46.083 --> 00:10:51.125
the courage to make room
for new opportunities.

215
00:10:51.125 --> 00:10:52.458
Doing this

216
00:10:52.458 --> 00:10:55.166
builds a better future.

217
00:10:55.166 --> 00:10:56.250
It encourages the adoption

218
00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:59.750
of new, beneficial methods.

219
00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:04.333
Embrace modern technologies
and successful approaches.

220
00:11:04.333 --> 00:11:07.458
Inspire your organisation

221
00:11:07.458 --> 00:11:10.708
to move toward meaningful goals.

222
00:11:10.708 --> 00:11:12.750
Honouring the past

223
00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:15.208
and building a better future,

224
00:11:15.208 --> 00:11:18.291
balancing these two aspects

225
00:11:18.291 --> 00:11:23.000
ensures the flourishing of the organisation.

226
00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.875
Always remember, however good

227
00:11:25.875 --> 00:11:29.666
or difficult the present may be,

228
00:11:29.666 --> 00:11:32.375
it is temporary.

229
00:11:32.375 --> 00:11:35.500
Change and renewal

230
00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:39.125
are an inevitable part of the natural cycle.

231
00:11:39.125 --> 00:11:41.083
Lead with humility, knowledge,

232
00:11:41.083 --> 00:11:44.333
and clarity.

233
00:11:44.333 --> 00:11:49.416
Success and satisfaction will surely come to you.
